# Generated by the scripts in this folder. Both rebuild offline in seconds from files
# already in the repo, so they are kept locally but never committed -- same rule as
# data/sst/.gitignore, and for the same reason: a ~450 kB PNG rewritten on every run is
# exactly the history bloat data/README.md warns about.
#
#   sst_vs_folger_four_panel.png  <- make_comparison.py
#   preview_compare_points.png    <- preview_compare_points.py
sst_vs_folger_four_panel.png
preview_compare_points.png

# NOT ignored, deliberately:
#   ../folger_compare_points.geojson   the layer the map app consumes. Committed for the
#                                      same reason sst_barkley_layer.geojson is -- the
#                                      app reads it from main, and a consumer should
#                                      never have to run this folder to get it.
